              "text": "Compared the old [`software_markdown.md`](https://github.com/iesl/iesl.github.io) with `_software/` on the new site. Five projects were missing:\n\n| Project | Old link |\n|---|---|\n| ChainsofReasoning | https://rajarshd.github.io/ChainsofReasoning/ |\n| Compositional Universal Schema | https://github.com/patverga/torch-relation-extraction |\n| SPEN | https://github.com/davidBelanger/SPEN |\n| Factorie | http://factorie.cs.umass.edu |\n| Mallet | http://mallet.cs.umass.edu/ |\n\nAdded these as new entries in `_software/`:\n\n- `chains_of_reasoning.md`\n- `compositional_universal_schema.md`\n- `spen.md`\n- `factorie.md`\n- `mallet.md`\n\nEach follows the same front matter pattern as the existing entries (`redirect`, `importance: 3`, `category: work`).\n\nAlso fixed `text_kb_qa.md`, which was already present but missing `category` and `importance`, so it would not show on the software page.\n\nThe new site now has all 11 projects from the old list, plus **Box Embeddings Library** (new). Already present: BRAN, DIVE, MINERVA, PERCH, ID-CNN, TextKBQA.\n\n**Note:** There are still six al-folio placeholder files (`_1_project.md` … `_6_project.md`) in `_software/` that may appear as “project 1”, “project 2”, etc. on the page. I can remove or hide those if you want."
